11
00:00:41,139 --> 00:00:46,094
At this point, I want to know which
step failed, what is reported, what is

12
00:00:46,094 --> 00:00:48,508
the error, and what I can test next.

13
00:00:49,362 --> 00:00:53,695
So if I give Codex that run link,
