75
00:04:44,325 --> 00:04:46,444
That gives me a reasonable first test.

76
00:04:46,764 --> 00:04:50,725
I can check the training configuration,
change the batch size in a small run, and

77
00:04:50,725 --> 00:04:53,229
see if the, if the same step gets further.

78
00:04:53,883 --> 00:04:57,286
So usually, I would review the
change before submit a run.

79
00:04:57,504 --> 00:04:59,985
I'd also check the
evaluation score afterwards.

80
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:03,929
A smaller batch can change the
training behavior, so finishing the

81
