93
00:05:52,852 --> 00:05:55,714
So after training, we usually
want to deploy the model.

94
00:05:56,231 --> 00:05:59,895
so the top row is what we just discussed.

95
00:06:00,863 --> 00:06:05,474
Codex, Flyte MCP and Flyte work
together for model training purposes.

96
00:06:06,478 --> 00:06:11,355
